# 畫面文字（screen_pick）。鍵名為「screen_pick-」加上取自英文的簡短名稱，工具提示的鍵名以 -tip 結尾。

screen_pick-pick-screen-color = 擷取螢幕顏色
screen_pick-hide-window-and-pick-screen = 隱藏視窗並擷取螢幕顏色
screen_pick-screen-color-picking-is-available = 擷取螢幕顏色僅支援 Windows
screen_pick-screen-capture-unavailable = 無法擷取螢幕
screen_pick-screen-color-picker-unavailable = 無法啟動螢幕取色
screen_pick-screen-capture-size-limit-exceeded = 螢幕大小超過擷取上限
